# TARSphere: Wasm-Verified Skill Framework

## Secure Execution Gate
```rust
struct WasmBridge { buffer: FixedPool<2048>, validator: IntegrityCheck }

impl WasmBridge {
    fn invoke_safely(&self, blob: &[u8]) -> Result<(), SecurityError> {
        self.validator.verify_hash(blob)?; // SHA-256 handoff proof
        let memory = self.buffer.allocate()?; // Fixed-size memory allocation
        self.engine.run(blob, memory)
    }
}
```
## Key Improvements
1. **Memory Stability**: Fixed-pool allocation eliminates heap fragmentation.
2. **Security**: SHA-256 verification ensures only vetted skills enter the runtime environment.
